<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn fed cattle not well tested - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn fed cattle not well tested - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iowa-southern Minnesota feedlot cattle trading was not well tested.</p>
<p>Live Sales: Slaughter steers and heifers not well established. Trade slow. Demand and seller interest light.</p>
<p>Offerings light.</p>
<p>    Steers: Select to mostly Choice 2-4	no sales</p>
<p>    Heifers: Select-Choice 2-4 1150 lbs pt ld   68.00</p>
<p>		  Carcass Basis (weight only)</p>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers not well tested.</p>
<p>Steers: Select and Choice 2-4 1275 lbs pt ld 108.00 Holstein: (weight only)</p>
<p>Select to mostly Choice 2-3 1250-1400 lbs	   103.00</p>
<p>Holsteins: ( grade &amp; weight)</p>
<p>Choice 2-3 1250-1450 lbs				  no sales</p>
<p>Select 2-3 1250-1450 lbs				  no sales</p>
<p>Heifers:  Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1150 lbs ld	110.00</p>
<p>Confirmed Sales:     300 Week Ago:   6,300 Year Ago:    5,300</p>
<p>Week to Date:	7,100 Week Ago:  24,300 Year Ago:   18,700</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
